<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n172" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ab-rādo</span></b> , si, sum, 3, v.
		a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to scratch
				off</i> or <i>away</i>, to <i>scrape
				away</i>, <i>rub off;</i> of the beard, <i>to shave.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manibus quidquam abradere membris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					4, 1103</span></i>
			; so <i><span class="en">id. 4, 1110</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">supercilia penitus abrasa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Rosc. Com. 7, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">barbam in superiore labro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					6, 28, 32, § 162</span></i>
			.—Of plants: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">partes radicum,</span>”
				<i>to grub up</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 11, 16, § 82</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arida,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					10, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">abrasae fauces,</span>”
				<i>made rough</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					6, 115</span></i>
			: abrasa corpora, <i>peeled off</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσύρματα</span>, <i><span class="en">Scrib.
				Comp. 215</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			
			<b>Meton.</b>, <i>to take</i> or <i>snatch away</i>, <i>to seize</i>, <i>extort</i>, <i>rob</i>, <i><span class="en">Ter. Phorm.
				2, 2, 19</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nihil a Caecinā litium terrore,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Caecin. 7, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquid bohis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Pan. 37, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
